# No fake functionality

Full spec: `docs/product/PRODUCT_RULES.md`

**Never create a visual representation of functionality that does not exist.**

If UI shows a feature, the **full functional path** must work — or label **NOT IMPLEMENTED** honestly.

**Forbidden in production paths:**

- Fake search · upload · payment · dashboard stats · AI generation · notifications · profiles · filters  
- Dead buttons · placeholder cards as real content · “Coming soon” on presented complete features  

Mocks OK **only** when explicitly labeled development fixtures.

**AI features:** prompt → validation → request → loading → result → storage → persistence → history — not fake “Your design is ready!”

Implement it **or** don’t ship the control.
